ation-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/90 text-brand-cream font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/masuk\">Masuk / Daftar</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-full text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><nav class=\"flex text-sm text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-900 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Kti builder</span></div></li></ol></nav></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container py-8 md:py-12 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mb-8 max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Pembuat Karya Tulis Ilmiah (KTI)</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-lg\">Tugas akhir kelas 11/12 yang paling bikin pusing. Masukkan judul KTI-mu, pilih metode, dan AI akan membuatkan kerangka lengkap Latar Belakang (BAB I), Teori (BAB II), dan Metodologi (BAB III) sebagai panduan menulismu.</p></div><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-md mb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenjang Pendidikan</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SD</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMP</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-bold shadow-sm\">SMA</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMK</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">MADRASAH</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kelas</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Kelas</option><option value=\"10\">Kelas <!-- -->10</option><option value=\"11\">Kelas <!-- -->11</option><option value=\"12\">Kelas <!-- -->12</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Mata Pelajaran</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Mapel</option><option value=\"Bahasa Indonesia\">Bahasa Indonesia</option><option value=\"Matematika\">Matematika</option><option value=\"Fisika\">Fisika</option><option value=\"Kimia\">Kimia</option><option value=\"Biologi\">Biologi</option><option value=\"Sejarah\">Sejarah</option><option value=\"Geografi\">Geografi</option><option value=\"Bahasa Inggris\">Bahasa Inggris</option><option value=\"PPKn\">PPKn</option><option value=\"Agama\">Agama</option><option value=\"PJOK\">PJOK</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kurikulum</label><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" checked=\"\" value=\"merdeka\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">Merdeka</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" value=\"k13\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">2013 (K13)</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Topik / Judul Karya Tulis Ilmiah (KTI)</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Efektivitas Penggunaan Botol Plastik Bekas sebagai Sistem Hidroponik...\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all disabled:opacity-50\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenis Penelitian / Metode</label><select class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all disabled:opacity-50 appearance-none\"><option value=\"Kualitatif Deskriptif\" selected=\"\">Kualitatif Deskriptif (Observasi &amp; Wawancara)</option><option value=\"Kuantitatif (Eksperimen / Survei)\">Kuantitatif (Eksperimen / Angket Kuesioner)</option><option value=\"Studi Pustaka (Literature Review)\">Studi Pustaka (Menganalisis Buku/Jurnal)</option><option value=\"Pengembangan Produk (R&amp;D)\">Pengembangan Produk (Membuat Inovasi Baru)</option></select></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-sm disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">science</span><span>Buat Kerangka KTI (BAB I - III)</span></button></form><div class=\"mt-16 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-heading prose-a:text-sky-600\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-microscope w-6 h-6 text-sky-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18h8\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M14 22a7 7 0 1 0 0-14h-1\"></path><path d=\"M9 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6h6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 6V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3\"></path></svg>Tips Mengerjakan KTI Agar Acc Guru Pembimbing</h2><p>Karya Tulis Ilmiah (KTI) berbeda jauh dengan makalah biasa. KTI menuntutmu untuk melakukan penelitian mini, mengumpulkan data, dan menganalisisnya secara objektif, bukan sekadar meringkas teori dari buku cetak.</p><h3>Benang Merah Penelitian (The Golden Thread)</h3><p>Kesalahan paling umum siswa saat sidang KTI adalah tidak adanya &quot;Benang Merah&quot;. Benang merah berarti:</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Apa yang kamu tanyakan di <strong>Rumusan Masalah (Bab I)</strong>...</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Harus ada pisau analisis teorinya di <strong>Tinjauan Pustaka (Bab II)</strong>...</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Harus dijawab secara urut di <strong>Pembahasan (Bab IV)</strong>...</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Dan dirangkum persis urutannya di <strong>Kesimpulan (Bab V)</strong>.</span></li></ul><p>Jika rumusan masalahmu ada 2, maka kesimpulanmu juga harus ada 2. Tidak boleh kurang, tidak boleh lebih. Tool ini didesain oleh Dosen Pembimbing untuk mengamankan <em>Golden Thread</em> tersebut sejak awal kamu mengajukan judul.</p></div></div></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-heading\">TugasMu.c